      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4f15467f834be9c",
      "translationZh": "开发者如何验证编码代理读取、发送和存储的内容？这是最近被广泛讨论的话题。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80604da7d1bddcb5",
      "translationZh": "开源代理并不能自动回答所有隐私或安全问题，但它为社区提供了可检查的具体内容。",
      "provider": "openrouter",
      "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-super-120b-a12b:free"
    },
